+- Add event severity:
+  - info
+  - warning
+  - error
+- Add event type constants.
+- Add helper function:
+  Emit(ctx, Event)
+- Do not let event emission failure crash critical paths unless explicitly configured.
+- Add API filtering:
+  - by service_id
+  - by task_id
+  - by node_id
+  - by type
+  - by severity
+  - since timestamp
+- Add CLI:
+  orch events
